  "contentHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"1227\" class=\"elementor elementor-1227\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7ef21502 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"93105\" data-id=\"7ef21502\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7fd1f1a3\" data-eae-slider=\"64471\" data-id=\"7fd1f1a3\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-62a07c5a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"62a07c5a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><br></h2><h2>North Carolina Lottery Games</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>Only North Carolina residents can take part in the following North Carolina lottery games:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-OpeningHours-no-5\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-OpeningHours tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Prize Type</th><th class=\"column-3\">Numbers</th><th class=\"column-4\">Sale Closes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Daytime</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">3 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">2:45 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">3 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">10:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Daytime</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">4 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">2:45 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">4 from 0-9</td><td class=\"column-4\">10:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-43</td><td class=\"column-4\">10:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-69 + 1 from 1-26</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">Jackpot</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-70 + 1 from 1-25</td><td class=\"column-4\">10:45 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lucky for Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">Top Prize</td><td class=\"column-3\">5 from 1-48 + 1 from 1-18</td><td class=\"column-4\">9:30 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2><br></h2><h2>Game Schedule</h2>\n<p><br></p><div id=\"tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule-no-5-scroll-wrapper\" class=\"tablepress-scroll-wrapper\">\n\n<table id=\"tablepress-ImportIODrawScheudule-no-5\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-ImportIODrawScheudule tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Sunday</th><th class=\"column-3\">Monday</th><th class=\"column-4\">Tuesday</th><th class=\"column-5\">Wednesday</th><th class=\"column-6\">Thursday</th><th class=\"column-7\">Friday</th><th class=\"column-8\">Saturday</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Daytime</td><td class=\"column-2\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">3:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">11:22 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Daytime</td><td class=\"column-2\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">3:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">3:00 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">11:22 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-3\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\">11:22 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\">11:22 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\">10:59 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\">10:59 p.m.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\"></td><td class=\"column-4\">11:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-5\"></td><td class=\"column-6\"></td><td class=\"column-7\">11:00 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-8\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lucky for Life</td><td class=\"column-2\"></td><td class=\"column-3\">11:45 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-4\"></td><td class=\"column-5\"></td><td class=\"column-6\">11:45 p.m.</td><td class=\"column-7\"></td><td class=\"column-8\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n<p><br></p><p>*All times are displayed in North Carolina local time.</p>\n<h2><br></h2><h2>Advance Draws</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>The number of consecutive draws each North Carolina State Lottery games allows you to play:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-AdvancedDraws-no-5\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-AdvancedDraws tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Game</th><th class=\"column-2\">Advanced Draws</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Daytime</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 3 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-4\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Daytime</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-5\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Pick 4 Evening</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 7</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-6\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Cash 5</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 28</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-7\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Powerball</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-8\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Mega Millions</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-9\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Lucky for Life</td><td class=\"column-2\">up to 26</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2><br></h2><h2>North Carolina Tax Information</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>North Carolina Lottery Federal, and state tax withholdings on winnings for U.S. citizens or residents.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-USResidentsTax-no-5\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-USResidentsTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">$600 and up to $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">5.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">$600 and up to $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">0.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p><br></p><p>If the winner is not a U.S. citizen or is not a US resident, North Carolina Lottery tax withholdings on winnings are as such:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<table id=\"tablepress-NonUSTax-no-5\" class=\"tablepress tablepress-id-NonUSTax tablepress-responsive\">\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-1\">\n\t<th class=\"column-1\">Winnings</th><th class=\"column-2\">Tax Category</th><th class=\"column-3\">Percentage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody class=\"row-striping row-hover\">\n<tr class=\"row-2\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">State Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">5.5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-3\">\n\t<td class=\"column-1\">Over $5,000</td><td class=\"column-2\">Federal Tax</td><td class=\"column-3\">24.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<figure><br></figure><figure><img decoding=\"async\" title=\"\" src=\"/wp-media/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/North-Carolina.jpg\" alt=\"\"><p></p>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<h2><br></h2><h2>The North Carolina Lottery</h2>\n<p><br></p><p>In 1903, the Wright brothers pulled off the first successful powered flight near Kitty Hawk, North Carolina. It would be more than a century before North Carolinians could buy lottery tickets to give flight to their dreams of riches successfully. The North Carolina State Lottery is known as the NC Education Lottery, leaving no doubt about this lottery's purpose.&nbsp;&nbsp;The nationwide giants like Mega Millions and Powerball attract the most players, but other games like Carolina Cash 5, Carolina Pick 4, and Carolina Pick 3 also have a large and dedicated following. Cash 5 has odds of 1 in 84,000 and has yielded jackpots of over $1 million.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>There are also numerous scratch card games. In North Carolina, these are known as scratch-offs and can range in price from $1 to $30. You have a chance of 1 in 2.90 to break even, and the top-end prizes are around $10 million.&nbsp;Tickets can be bought at any of over 7,000 participating retailers.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>North Carolina also provides Play at the Pump stations at gas stations all over the state. It makes playing the lottery a matter of passing the time while taking a break!</p><p><br></p>\n<h2>North Carolina Lottery FAQ</h2><div><br></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-8eebdfb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"78751\" data-id=\"8eebdfb\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a455e95\" data-eae-slider=\"15797\" data-id=\"a455e95\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b3aee4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-accordion\" data-id=\"6b3aee4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t            <div class=\"eael-adv-accordion\" id=\"eael-adv-accordion-6b3aee4\" data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" data-accordion-id=\"6b3aee4\" data-accordion-type=\"accordion\" data-toogle-speed=\"300\">\n            <div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-north-carolina\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1121\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Requirements to Buy Lottery Tickets in North Carolina?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1121\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"1\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-requirements-to-buy-lottery-tickets-in-north-carolina\"><p>Your North Carolina lottery scratch and draw tickets are only available in-store. Players must be at least 18. A North Carolina lottery app allows you to purchase tickets, check North Carolina lottery results, and get info on North Carolina lottery codes. The app is also a North Carolina lottery ticket scanner for checking your draw or scratch tickets.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-north-carolina\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1122\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Lottery Games Can You Play in North Carolina?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1122\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"2\" aria-labelledby=\"what-lottery-games-can-you-play-in-north-carolina\"><p>You can play familiar nationwide games, such as Mega Millions and Powerball. North Carolina Lottery Lucky for Life is also a popular choice. Other titles include: </p><p> </p><p>Carolina Cash 5 – Choose five numbers from 1-43.</p><p>Carolina Pick 4 – Choose four numbers to match the draw in the correct order.</p><p>Carolina Pick 3 – Choose three numbers to match the draw in the correct order.</p><p>Where and How Do I Claim Winnings from the North Carolina Lottery?</p><p> </p><p>When the North Carolina lottery results fall in your favor and you need to claim your prize, the size of the prize determines your options. Prizes over $599 can be claimed at retail outlets,  lottery headquarters, any lottery claim center, or through the mail.  Prizes from $600 and above can be claimed at the claim centers and lottery headquarters.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"how-do-you-play-and-win-in-the-north-carolina-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1123\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">How Do You Play and Win in the North Carolina Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1123\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"3\" aria-labelledby=\"how-do-you-play-and-win-in-the-north-carolina-lottery\"><p>Your numbers need to match the North Carolina Lottery numbers. For instance, Carolina Cash 5 requires a player to pick numbers between 1-43. The objective is to choose five numbers that will appear in the draw. Smaller prizes can be won with fewer matched North Carolina Lottery winning numbers.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-north-carolina-lottery\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1124\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Are the Odds of Winning the North Carolina Lottery?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1124\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"4\" aria-labelledby=\"what-are-the-odds-of-winning-the-north-carolina-lottery\"><p>Odds for winning the North Carolina lottery Mega Millions are 1 in 302 million. For the North Carolina Lottery Powerball jackpot it is 1 in 175 million. Other odds are as follows:</p><p> </p><p>Lucky for Life: 1 in 31 million</p><p>Carolina Cash 5: 1 in 84,000</p><p>Carolina Pick 4: 1 in 10,000</p><p>Carolina Pick 3: 1 in 1000</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"whats-the-biggest-north-carolina-lottery-win\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1125\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What’s the Biggest North Carolina Lottery Win?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1125\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"5\" aria-labelledby=\"whats-the-biggest-north-carolina-lottery-win\"><p>North Carolina Lottery winners pocket about $4 million in prizes every day. In 2019, $344.6 million of that money went to Charles Jackson Jr.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"when-is-the-north-carolina-lottery-results-draw\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1126\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">When Is the North Carolina Lottery Results Draw?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1126\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"6\" aria-labelledby=\"when-is-the-north-carolina-lottery-results-draw\"><p>The results of the North Carolina lottery take place at the following approximate times:</p><p> </p><p>Mega Millions: Tuesdays and Fridays at 11 pm.</p><p>Powerball: Wednesdays and Saturdays at 11 pm</p><p>Lucky for Life: Mondays and Thursdays 10:35 pm</p><p>Carolina Cash 5: Daily at 11:20</p><p>Carolina Pick 4 and Pick 3: Daily at 3 pm and 11:22 pm</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"what-is-the-north-carolina-lottery-second-chance\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1127\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">What Is the North Carolina Lottery Second Chance?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1127\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"what-is-the-north-carolina-lottery-second-chance\"><p>You can enter non-winning scratch cards for more chances to win. Scratch tickets can be entered into North Carolina Lottery Second Chance draws for prizes up to $100 000.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div><div class=\"eael-accordion-list\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-north-carolina-lottery-winnings\" class=\"elementor-tab-title eael-accordion-header\" tabindex=\"0\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-controls=\"elementor-tab-content-1128\"><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-closed\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-plus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-advanced-accordion-icon-opened\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-accordion-icon fas fa-minus\"></i></span><span class=\"eael-accordion-tab-title\">Do I Have to Pay Tax on North Carolina Lottery Winnings?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa-toggle fas fa-angle-right\"></i></div><div id=\"elementor-tab-content-1128\" class=\"eael-accordion-content clearfix\" data-tab=\"8\" aria-labelledby=\"do-i-have-to-pay-tax-on-north-carolina-lottery-winnings\"><p>North Carolina lottery winners will pay state tax on winnings starting at $600. Up to $5000, a state tax of 5.499% will be withheld. Over $5000, 5.499% state tax and 24% federal tax is payable.</p></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div></div>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-b99b654 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"21834\" data-id=\"b99b654\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5b46c52\" data-eae-slider=\"94950\" data-id=\"5b46c52\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8293ade elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8293ade\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Got more questions about the North Carolina Lottery? </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-21becd8\" data-eae-slider=\"90427\" data-id=\"21becd8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-13bb3d7 elementor-button-success elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"13bb3d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-lg\" href=\"/Contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Send Us an Email</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-6cb39ea elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-eae-slider=\"6079\" data-id=\"6cb39ea\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4aa8bc8\" data-eae-slider=\"37725\" data-id=\"4aa8bc8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c82d5e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c82d5e8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Are the Requirements to Buy Lottery Tickets in North Carolina?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Your North Carolina lottery scratch and draw tickets are only available in-store. Players must be at least 18. A North Carolina lottery app allows you to purchase tickets, check North Carolina lottery results, and get info on North Carolina lottery codes. The app is also a North Carolina lottery ticket scanner for checking your draw or scratch tickets.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Lottery Games Can You Play in North Carolina?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can play familiar nationwide games, such as Mega Millions and Powerball. North Carolina Lottery Lucky for Life is also a popular choice. Other titles include: \\n\\n \\n\\nCarolina Cash 5 \\u2013 Choose five numbers from 1-43.\\n\\nCarolina Pick 4 \\u2013 Choose four numbers to match the draw in the correct order.\\n\\nCarolina Pick 3 \\u2013 Choose three numbers to match the draw in the correct order.\\n\\nWhere and How Do I Claim Winnings from the North Carolina Lottery?\\n\\n \\n\\nWhen the North Carolina lottery results fall in your favor and you need to claim your prize, the size of the prize determines your options. Prizes over $599 can be claimed at retail outlets,  lottery headquarters, any lottery claim center, or through the mail.  Prizes from $600 and above can be claimed at the claim centers and lottery headquarters.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How Do You Play and Win in the North Carolina Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Your numbers need to match the North Carolina Lottery numbers. For instance, Carolina Cash 5 requires a player to pick numbers between 1-43. The objective is to choose five numbers that will appear in the draw. Smaller prizes can be won with fewer matched North Carolina Lottery winning numbers.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Are the Odds of Winning the North Carolina Lottery?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Odds for winning the North Carolina lottery Mega Millions are 1 in 302 million. For the North Carolina Lottery Powerball jackpot it is 1 in 175 million. Other odds are as follows:\\n\\n \\n\\nLucky for Life: 1 in 31 million\\n\\nCarolina Cash 5: 1 in 84,000\\n\\nCarolina Pick 4: 1 in 10,000\\n\\nCarolina Pick 3: 1 in 1000\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What\\u2019s the Biggest North Carolina Lottery Win?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"North Carolina Lottery winners pocket about $4 million in prizes every day. In 2019, $344.6 million of that money went to Charles Jackson Jr.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"When Is the North Carolina Lottery Results Draw?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The results of the North Carolina lottery take place at the following approximate times:\\n\\n \\n\\nMega Millions: Tuesdays and Fridays at 11 pm.\\n\\nPowerball: Wednesdays and Saturdays at 11 pm\\n\\nLucky for Life: Mondays and Thursdays 10:35 pm\\n\\nCarolina Cash 5: Daily at 11:20\\n\\nCarolina Pick 4 and Pick 3: Daily at 3 pm and 11:22 pm\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What Is the North Carolina Lottery Second Chance?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can enter non-winning scratch cards for more chances to win. Scratch tickets can be entered into North Carolina Lottery Second Chance draws for prizes up to $100 000.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Do I Have to Pay Tax on North Carolina Lottery Winnings?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"North Carolina lottery winners will pay state tax on winnings starting at $600. Up to $5000, a state tax of 5.499% will be withheld. Over $5000, 5.499% state tax and 24% federal tax is payable.\"}}]}</script>\r\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t",
